# The Life one-liner (docs/design.md 6.2).
== SOURCE
life = { (+^r -1 0 1 t_12 _r) { (_l = 3) + _r * _l = 4 } _r }
== TOKENS
0..4 Noun(life)
5..6 Func(=)
7..8 LBrace
9..10 LParen
10..13 Func(+, deriv=r)
14..16 Num(-1)
17..18 Num(0)
19..20 Num(1)
21..25 Func(t, axes=[1,2])
26..28 LamArg(r)
28..29 RParen
30..31 LBrace
32..33 LParen
33..35 LamArg(l)
36..37 Func(=)
38..39 Num(3)
39..40 RParen
41..42 Func(+)
43..45 LamArg(r)
46..47 Func(*)
48..50 LamArg(l)
51..52 Func(=)
53..54 Num(4)
55..56 RBrace
57..59 LamArg(r)
60..61 RBrace
